From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] discover every sensor type provided by a hotplugged device

A FastRPC node exposes several SSC sensor types. Stopping after the first
matching driver loses the remaining types when the node appears during
initial asynchronous discovery. Process each unregistered type in the
same device event.

--- a/src/iio-sensor-proxy.c
+++ b/src/iio-sensor-proxy.c
@@ -1113,7 +1113,6 @@
 					if (!start_claimed_sensor (data, driver->type))
 						send_driver_changed_dbus_event (data, driver->type);
 				}
-				break;
 			}
 		}
 	}
